# Keep line endings out of the diff.
#
# This repo is edited from both Windows and Linux. Without this file, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites every LF to CRLF, so `git status` reports the whole tree as modified and
# real changes are impossible to spot. `text=auto` stores LF in the repository and checks out whatever
# the platform wants, so a diff only ever shows a real edit.
* text=auto

# Images are binary: never touch their bytes.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# A lockfile is generated; keep it out of review noise.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff
